# Frontend environment template (no real values).
#
# RUM (task 10.5): the OTLP/HTTP metrics endpoint the browser posts Web Vitals and custom marks to.
# Leave empty to disable RUM entirely (e.g. local development without a collector). In development
# set it to the proxied path so the browser request stays same-origin; in production set it to the
# collector's public OTLP/HTTP metrics URL.
#
#   VITE_OTLP_METRICS_URL=/v1/metrics
VITE_OTLP_METRICS_URL=
